uriparser
------------------------------------------
uriparser is a strictly RFC 3986 compliant URI parsing and handling library
written in C. uriparser is cross-platform, fast, supports Unicode and is
licensed under the New BSD license.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  liburiparser-devel-1.0.3-1bl1
  liburiparser1-1.0.3-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/uriparser/uriparser/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/uriparser/uriparser/releases/download/uriparser-1.0.3/uriparser-1.0.3.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack uriparser-1.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./uriparser-1.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/uriparser-1.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/uriparser-1.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburiparser1-1.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburiparser-devel-1.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(uriparser)
